# Survey & Excel

## Survey domain

Support CRUD, search, filter, sort, pagination, bulk, import, export, attachments, audit. All **15 Chhata wards** via a Ward entity — never hard-code ward names.

## Excel import flow

Upload → validate → column detect/map → preview → row validate → duplicates → confirm → background job → Postgres → disk attachments → import report.

Always report: total, success, failed, warnings, duplicates, inserted, updated, skipped. Never silently discard data.

## Data safety

Real business workbooks: do not overwrite source files, silently transform/drop columns, or silently overwrite existing records. Preserve originals; handle duplicate headers explicitly.

## Embedded images

Excel → extract → disk (`STORAGE_DIR`) → `SurveyAttachment` (or equivalent) → associate with survey. If association is unsafe, **warn** — do not guess.

## Reports

Aggregate in the backend with the same filters as the UI. Do not pull full datasets into Next.js for totals.
